362: #### 3. 配置 PM2
363: 
364: 创建 `pm2.json` 文件：
365: 
366: ```json
367: {
368:   "name": "toonflow-app",
369:   "script": "data/serve/app.js",
370:   "instances": "max",
371:   "exec_mode": "cluster",
372:   "env": {
373:     "NODE_ENV": "prod",
374:     "PORT": 10588,
375:     "OSSURL": "http://127.0.0.1:10588/"
376:   }
377: }
378: ```
